<section class="questions-section section-shell" id="questions" aria-labelledby="questions-heading"><div class="questions-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>06</span> / Questions</p><h2 id="questions-heading">GOOD<br>QUESTIONS.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>What is the TRAYN standard?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>A commitment to premium whey and no compromise on quality. Belgian Chocolate is our whey protein concentrate, with 23 g protein (dry basis) per approximately 33 g serving.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>How do I order?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Choose Belgian Chocolate in the Shop section. When available, add it to your cart, review the quantity and continue to checkout. Delivery and payment options are shown there.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Where can I read the full label?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Read the nutrition, ingredients and directions in The Product section, explore Back Label in the packaging viewer, or <a href="{{ 'belgian-chocolate-wpc-back-label.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open the original product label</a>.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Does it contain allergens?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Contains milk. Review the full ingredient list and usage guidance in The Product section and on the product label.</p></div></details><div class="faq-end" aria-hidden="true"><i class="faq-rule faq-rule-final"></i></div></div></section>

